---
---
<section id="industries" class="section-padding bg-gray-50">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Industries We Serve</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Data-sensitive industries where privacy-first AI makes the difference. Each sector has unique compliance and confidentiality requirements that on-premise AI solves natively.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
      <!-- Law Firms -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">⚖️</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Law Firms</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Client files, contracts, and court documents never leave the office; AI-powered document search and summarization without violating attorney-client privilege.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Healthcare -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🏥</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Healthcare</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Patient data (most sensitive category under GDPR) stays off the cloud; appointments, report summarization, and triage support run on local servers.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Accounting -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">📊</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Accounting</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Financial statements, tax records, and client financial data analyzed and reported without ever leaving the company.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Manufacturing -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🏭</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Manufacturing</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Production data, supplier contracts, and know-how analyzed by AI with zero leakage risk; works even during internet outages.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Engineering -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">⚙️</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Engineering</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Technical drawings, patented designs, and source code stay local; code generation and RAG documentation without external data leaks.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Real Estate -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🏠</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Real Estate</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Client financial data and contracts stay secure; listing and contract automation runs without cloud dependency.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Education -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🎓</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Education</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Student personal data (especially minors) never goes to third parties; local knowledge base (RAG) built on-premise.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Marketing Agencies -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">📱</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Marketing Agencies</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Client campaign data and strategies processed in isolated environments inaccessible to competitors.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Finance -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🏦</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Finance</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Regulatory data processing restrictions (banking regulations) conflict with cloud AI; on-premise solves this from the start.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Government -->
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🏛️</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Government</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Citizen data and national security documents don't go to US-based cloud; data sovereignty is guaranteed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Any Industry CTA -->
    <div class="text-center mt-16 p-8 md:p-12 bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-100">
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Any Industry. Any Workflow. Complete Privacy.</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-6">
        We build custom AI infrastructure tailored to your organization's workflows, security requirements and compliance needs.
        Whether you're a logistics company, architecture firm, insurance agency, or any other data-sensitive business —
        the same privacy-first architecture adapts to your processes.
      </p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2">
        Discuss Your Use Case
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>